{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0524_1000_p", "source_sha256": "0ee1ecedabfd329961cbeebcef0a62900e6c2b867196c397eb48140d5110ad0b", "ja": "（朋花のPV撮影が終わった。何度も聴いた曲なのに、\n映像と合わさるとすごい迫力だ……！）", "zh": "（朋花的PV拍摄结束了。明明是听过很多遍的歌，和影像结合起来后，气势真是惊人……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0524_1001_031tom", "source_sha256": "df4ee924ea5bcf316a8ac244e9e4752ac8ed6c8737f468573b5b8fcb645e4d0f", "ja": "お疲れ様です～。子豚ちゃん達も喜ぶ\n仕上がりになりそうですね。", "zh": "辛苦了～。看来成片会让小猪仔们也很开心呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0524_1002_p", "source_sha256": "1f96d42bcef1e893505a2ab6f2e40000303b2521b80391fc43a1ce7cd4dd9810", "ja": "ああ、みんな大満足だ！　いつも以上に迫力……\nいや、表現力が冴えてるようにみえたよ。", "zh": "啊，大家都非常满意！比平时更有气势……不，应该说表现力似乎更加出色了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0524_1003_031tom", "source_sha256": "27824d90df7e2e5397845363efd3cffd42d168e27a6a73caa24cc31f68752a69", "ja": "うふふっ、そうですね～。私も常に、\n聖母として成長を続けていますから～。", "zh": "呵呵，也是呢～。毕竟作为圣母，\n我也一直在不断成长嘛～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0524_1004_031tom", "source_sha256": "b592a7ba3fe40f5ac77afd8ff4c8debe0c9929bf9fe6a8b5ab1718d5442e5f3f", "ja": "そうでなければ、世界中の子豚ちゃん達に、\nあまねく慈愛を届けることはできません～。", "zh": "否则，就无法将慈爱遍洒给全世界的小猪仔们了～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0524_1005_p", "source_sha256": "05c29c3883000d2b2a033927a2e232f12a0b862dd3a8f30354881a1b8307f6b2", "ja": "ああ……本当に努力家だ。それをいつでも、\n当たり前のようにしてるんだから。", "zh": "啊……真是个努力的人啊。毕竟你一直都把这些当成理所当然的事在做。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0524_1006_031tom", "source_sha256": "19afaddd54668747990719ff5bb4c1cc9ad09085ae2382f382b0896d95fdb3bb", "ja": "のように、ではなく、当たり前なんです。\n上に立つ者として、示さないといけませんからね。", "zh": "不是“像理所当然一样”，而是本来就是理所当然。\n因为身居高位，就必须以身作则。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0524_1007_031tom", "source_sha256": "76339cc97410b53c0cc33a74332eae9443cca7b2a082d6e9106e1a03122fa5fd", "ja": "天空騎士団のみなさんも、誓いを守っています。\nその誠意に、私も向き合っているだけです。", "zh": "天空骑士团的各位也在遵守着誓言。\n而我也只是在认真回应这份诚意罢了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0524_1008_p", "source_sha256": "bf965d3854e7d99e08d2aa926d74ed2eb83b1cea50215b38e45b62f41ea1a554", "ja": "誓い……？", "zh": "誓言……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0524_1009_031tom", "source_sha256": "9a9482b6f2eb9fa5f1eb9240e20da49f225d954d4184962a4516904e1c5ddb79", "ja": "はい～。騎士団における決まり事……\n己を磨くための心構えのようなものですね。", "zh": "是的～就是骑士团的规矩……\n也就是为了磨炼自己而应有的觉悟。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0524_1010_031tom", "source_sha256": "e0de72f921ecfcf48a6c30f59a56241c00be155b689d0bbe51beb69d07a68c4b", "ja": "労働を惜しまないこと。精神を鍛えること。\n常に相応しくあること……。", "zh": "不吝惜劳动。锤炼精神。\n始终保持相称……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0524_1011_p", "source_sha256": "0708770529bbda0dcdb5c6676d476e3cd78585bb95a5356aea6a1b789ba6d509", "ja": "確か、七つの項目があるんだったな。\n己を律して、朋花に相応しくあろうとする……。", "zh": "好像是有七条来着。\n严于律己，努力成为配得上朋花的人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0524_1012_p", "source_sha256": "3476a6266ab2b02d93729765d2d5850e357759a5f5cadc3fbc2f35e4c8970c12", "ja": "すべては朋花のために。だから朋花も、\nその気持ちに全力で応えているんだな。", "zh": "一切都是为了朋花。所以朋花也在\n全力回应这份心意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0524_1013_031tom", "source_sha256": "ce88a5e2607e423196ea283f7248c0a4d44e42e7189d4d4a50cb21cd6adfcec2", "ja": "ええ。ですから、{$P$}さんも\n天空騎士団のみなさんを見習ってくださいね～。", "zh": "是的。所以，{$P$}先生也请向天空骑士团的各位学习哦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0524_1014_p", "source_sha256": "c9c64575925308009da819a6f7c58370950fe7e787e121f3c828f35bd78417bb", "ja": "ああ、そうだな……んっ？　見習う？", "zh": "啊，是啊……嗯？学习？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0524_1015_031tom", "source_sha256": "d93f2c9975ed058a158abacc3f0bbd5a23d8be989590c49ee57cc226f8d9cf6f", "ja": "うふっ。聞いたことがあるなら……\nもちろん、七つとも覚えていますよね～？", "zh": "呵呵。既然听说过……\n那当然，七条全部都记住了吧～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0524_1016_p", "source_sha256": "7fbce1de2e43087d74d7a6b2e27d6ec0210d45147a97f95931eea3bdc02ffde6", "ja": "あ、えーっと、た、たぶん……。", "zh": "啊，呃——这、这个……大概吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0524_1017_031tom", "source_sha256": "325de508d1d9b7c44c9eccd76699a6f271f8d7fb12107bc33c5fc794639ac429", "ja": "……あら～？　{$P$}さん。\nこんなことでは、みなさんに示しがつきませんね……。", "zh": "……哎呀～？{$P$}先生。\n这样子可没法给大家树立榜样呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0524_1018_p", "source_sha256": "06b1670a41357529385b2943663136067842bb093d01e0e124fdf5e7993e62fe", "ja": "うっ……申し訳ない。", "zh": "呜……实在抱歉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0524_1019_031tom", "source_sha256": "dbb611a683b6f2dea1d150dced4e3cf051830241efaaf6a12e12e97ea365fee3", "ja": "私が{$P$}さんを\nそばに置いているのは、それなりの理由があると……。", "zh": "我把{$P$}先生留在身边，是有我的理由的……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0524_1020_031tom", "source_sha256": "8105735a4088460c823e7c2c714732bd39b8ddaf45563a85546c4c9f2cdc35a7", "ja": "覚悟をもって、噛みしめてください。そして……\n三日後に、改めて誠意をみせてくださいね～♪", "zh": "请做好心理准备，好好铭记于心。然后……\n三天后，再向我展示您的诚意哦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0524_1021_p", "source_sha256": "d50cdcf5cb9e5c0b3e077af3ba5ae72a2a729568d56d6fb8f936572848f45c43", "ja": "（誰かの為……それが朋花の原動力だ。この先も朋花に\n恥じない人間に……その前に誓いを覚えないとっ！）", "zh": "（为了某个人……这就是朋花的动力。今后也要成为一个不让朋花蒙羞的人……在那之前，得先记住誓言才行！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
